1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,205
Clothes taking forever to dry?

2
00:00:02,566 --> 00:00:04,794
Your vent may be packed with lint.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:05,568
One.

4
00:00:05,859 --> 00:00:08,935
Unplug the dryer, and pull it out slowly.

5
00:00:10,085 --> 00:00:12,394
Gas dryers need a professional.

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,261
Two.

7
00:00:13,494 --> 00:00:16,131
Disconnect the duct, and use a brush kit

8
00:00:16,141 --> 00:00:18,370
and a vacuum to remove the lint.

9
00:00:18,567 --> 00:00:19,274
Three.

10
00:00:19,635 --> 00:00:23,546
Clear the outside vent flap, then test the
airflow.

11
00:00:23,733 --> 00:00:25,369
Full guide on the channel.
